      <title>利用“临界状态”（交界线星体）的跨界力</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/2026/04/%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%B4%E7%95%8C%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%BA%A4%E7%95%8C%E7%BA%BF%E6%98%9F%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%A8%E7%95%8C%E5%8A%9B/</link>
